        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FDB138, Solid Brass Floor Mount Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1-3/8\" high floor mounted door stops is made of solid brass by Deltana. Packaged with an installation stud this small floor mount door stop easy to install. It is typically used in residential and light duty commercial applications.\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FDB138-specifications.gif?v=1704354524\" width=\"431\" height=\"214\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana FBD138 Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FDB138 Floor Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Color: Gray</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting stud.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FDB138.pdf?v=1704262154\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FDB138 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
